Bundled verbatim here as LICENSE-APACHE2; the Pantheon adaptations are
marked in each file's header.

The async LLM diff-review half of the upstream plugin (hooks that sent
diffs to Claude for review) was NOT ported: Pantheon hook subprocesses
have no supported path to reach a model. The static pattern rules and
reminder text ARE ported, and the advisory channel is
transform_tool_result, which is the supported per-call path in Pantheon.
